        intervals [67]:
            xmin = 650.940
            xmax = 780.400
            text = "chunk_066: O yeah, ᏏᏭ ᎠᎹᏯ Ꮼ ᏧᏩᎩᎷᏨ Sixshooter ᏚᏙᎥ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾ ᏩᏩᏂᎩᏍᏛᏅ Ꮓ ᎪᎯᏗ Ꮩ ᎪᎯᏗ Ꮓ ᎤᎾ ᎯᎸᏍᎩ ᏧᏕᏘᏴᏗ about eighteen years ᎤᎾ ᏛᏃ ᎤᎾᏕᎸᎰᏒ ᎠᎭᏂ Cherokee Nation ᏓᎩᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᏩᏁᏙᎲᎮᏂ ᏩᏅᏑᏂᏙᎲ fishing dock ᎮᏂ ᎣᎪᏢᏒ ᎤᎾᏑᏂᎯᏍᏗ ᏴᏫ ᎤᎾᏕᎳᎰᏒ ᏩᏁᏙᎲ Ꮯhief Ross Swimmer, Bobbie ᎢᎾ ᏧᏙᎩᏗ ᎩᎶ ᏧᎾᎵᎪᏒ ᏓᎩᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎲ ᎨᏴ Ꮓ ᎤᏂᎷᏨ “we need your help” they said “you need my help? To catch a big fish, I'm going to have to take it out of the lake for you” “No Charley we bought Burnt Cabin, Burnt Cabin Marina, we want you to come over there and run it for us and fix it up. We need to fix it up really good and you got this place fixed up good we want that place fixed up that good.” “Well, I been working for this guy helping this guy run this place for many years about eighteen years, I can't just walk off and quit.” “Think about it” ᎠᏬᏎᎸ ᎾᎿ Ross Swimmer , “Think about it we sure need help over there we got people working over there rebuilding that place, but when they get off that dock it lays over.” It does! Yeah “what will make it do that” he said. They are not doing it right that is why it is doing that. That’s why we need your help ᎠᏬᏎᎸ ᏃᏭᏂ."
        intervals [68]:
            xmin = 780.400
            xmax = 878.210
            text = "chunk_067: You will be working for the nation, Cherokees, that is what I am. “Well, I will tell my boss what I am going to do, I got a boss here somewhere I will tell him, give him a notice, I can't just walk off and leave” ᏥᏲᎮᎸ Ꮎ Ross and “Ok think about it” ᎠᏬᏎᎸ “and when you make up your mind let us know” ok ᏥᏲᎮᎸ ᏍᏊ Ꮕ ᏭᎵᏍᏗᏅ ᎤᎾ ᎤᎩᏨᏚᏯ call ᏛᎥᏩᏁᎸ ᏃᎴ Bobbie ᏧᏙᎩᏓ ᎤᎾᎵᎪᏒ ᏭᏁᏙᎸ Ross, “Charley, have you thought about it?” “What do you think what are you talking about?” “Helping us on that boat dock!” “I aint had time to think about it yet I been doing some things I can't just stop and start thinking!” ᏥᏲᎮᎸ “Well think about it you got to come help us” ᏧᏛᏅ ᏛᏃ Ross ᏭᏪᏙᎳ ᏔᎵᏁ “ok” ᏥᏲᎮᎸ I will be there about four or five days from now. I got to let this guy know so he can have a replacement."
        intervals [69]:
            xmin = 878.210
            xmax = 991.260
            text = "chunk_068: ᎠᏪᏙᎵᏛ ᎤᏲᏣᏃᏅ ᎤᎾᏓᏁᎸ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏃᎴ ᏃᎬᏁᎸ ᏃᎴ ᎤᎾ ᏚᏂᎾᏝᎥ ᏴᏫ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎤᎾᏂᎩᏓ ᏗᎾᏁᏍᎨᏍᎩ ᎠᏛᏅ ᎠᏎᏃ Ꮭ ᏯᏂᎦᏔᎮ ᏧᎾᏁᎩᏍᏗ ᎠᎹᏯ ᏳᎾᏝᏍᎦᎦᎶ Ꮫ ᏬᎬᎴᏅᎲ Ꮓ  ᎦᏳᎳ ᎤᎾᏂᎩᏐᏅ ᎨᎲ Ꮓ ᏴᏫ boat ᏚᏅᏯ ᎤᎾ because it was run down. They didn’t want to stay in a rundown place ᎦᏳᎳ ᎤᎾᏂᎩᏐᏅ ᎨᎲ ᏙᎾ ᎦᏥᏍᏕᎸᎲ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏂᏙᎬᏁᎸ ᎤᎾ Ꮲ ᏏᏅᏗ ᎤᏢ ᏂᎨᏙᎰ ᏗᎧᎵ ᏛᎨᎰ Ꮎ ᏥᏳ ᏗᏗᏍᏗ ᎣᏍᏓ ᎢᏛ ᏕᎦᏙᎪ ᏓᏓᏁᎸ Ꮲ ᎠᏎ ᏑᏕᏘᏴᏓ ᎢᎪᎯᏓ ᏓᎩᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎸ ᎤᎾ ᎤᎷᏣ Ꮎ Ross ᎤᎾᎵᎪᏩᏕᎦ ᎠᏂᎩᏖᏃᎵᏙᎲ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏅᏍᎬ Ꭱ Ꮎ Charlie ᎠᏬᏎᎸ Ꮕ “we sold this place.” “After all this hard work I went through fixing this place you already sold it?” yeah and ok. ᏎᎦᏨ ᏓᎩᎸᎲ keys ᏗᎦᏙᏗ ᎤᎾ “here is the keys” ᏥᏲᎮᎸ “no I can't do that I got let that guy come in first show him around.” “Well, I aint got no job now since you sold this place.” “You stay here till that guy comes.” “Ok” ᎦᏥᏲᏎᎸ."
